  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Economic TA to Tuvalu  - 2024 to 2027</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This Activity will provide technical assistance to the Tuvalu Trust Fund Advisory Committee (TTFAC) and the Tuvalu Trust Fund Investment Committee (TFFIC). In addition, this Activity will fund a PACER Plus Support Person in the Government of Tuvalu&apos;s Department for Trade. It will also fund the TTFAC&apos;s mission to the outer islands of&#xa0;Vaitupu, Nanumaga and Nanumea.</narrative>
  </description>
